<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="legal-content">
    <h2>1. Information Collection</h2>
    <p>We value your privacy. This website does not collect personal data through registration forms or cookies. Any information provided through contact forms is used solely to respond to your inquiry.</p>
    
    <h2>2. Log Data</h2>
    <p>Like most websites, we may collect log data that your browser automatically sends whenever you visit our site. This may include your browser type, IP address, and the pages you visit.</p>
    
    <h2>3. Third Party Services</h2>
    <p>We may use third-party analytics services to understand how visitors interact with the site. These services may collect non-identifiable aggregate data.</p>

    <h2>4. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete any personal information we hold about you. Please contact us for such requests.</p>
  </div>
</LegalLayout>
